Upstream-Name: zyphra-textnorm
Source: https://github.com/Zyphra/zyphra-textnorm
Comment: The orig tarball is the release commit of 0.3.2 (8a73d05, untagged) with the crates of
 Cargo.lock in vendor/ (cargo vendor); the crates are linked in
 statically. NOTICE lists the third-party parts; their licence texts are
 in licenses/, each crate's own in vendor/<crate>/.

